  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7413d596d8ab64a",
      "translationZh": "在官方 JevBench 评测套件中，Gevva0 得分为 74.63（全球排名 #1），在大型法律合同集上的平均 p50 延迟为 214ms，在取证高难度档位上的准确率为 82.9%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3b918b657bba530",
      "translationZh": "其底层工作原理如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6815a706dc3c049",
      "translationZh": "直接 Logit 评分：在单次预填充过程中接收上下文，并直接从 llm.scores[-1] 读取决策 logits。在短上下文中，快速路径可在 22ms 内完成判定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a76bdd9b53e9514",
      "translationZh": "循环去偏：在 4 个循环位置间置换类别 token，以消除标签位置偏差。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e9f2a4ebab93b48",
      "translationZh": "Platt 温度校准：通过 sigmoid 缩放拟合置信度，将期望校准误差（ECE）降至 0.03 以下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9908235a7cf9e98",
      "translationZh": "非对称审计轮次：首先永久锁定类别判定结果，然后执行独立的提取轮次，逐字提取原文引文，避免污染决策 logit。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3523c1b61b19120e",
      "translationZh": "该仓库包含评测框架、原始基准测试数据集和本地网页仪表盘：https://github.com/solvingSteve/Gevva0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5fe72bee4bfd0b8",
      "translationZh": "安装配置说明和基准测试结果见 README。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
